    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1276170/extras/64b32994f65aa31d26cabda61fa8fd84.avif?t=1680605786\" /></div><br><br><strong>Nurse, clean up in the ward!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Feel the speed while you stop the spread in this fast paced arcade shooter<br></li><li>Harness the power of the VacciMax 9000 and wipe out the germs before they erradicate you<br></li><li>Collect pills scattered about the hospital to keep the virus at bay<br></li><li>Survive the madness of crazy physics as cans, tables, chairs, computers and much, much more fly across your path<br></li><li>Rack up the multipliers and destroy the top scores<br></li><li>Bring your skills or you won't last long... this game isn't for the easy <br></li><li><strong>Halloween Update - Now includes 'The Grounds' outdoor level and all new nasties to eliminate!</strong></li></ul><br>Time is running out and you're running about!<br><br><strong>You ready to blast some bugs?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1276170/extras/143597443d0541b6e98b6168467ce739.avif?t=1680605786\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1276170/extras/64b32994f65aa31d26cabda61fa8fd84.avif?t=1680605786\" /></div><br><br><strong>Nurse, clean up in the ward!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Feel the speed while you stop the spread in this fast paced arcade shooter<br></li><li>Harness the power of the VacciMax 9000 and wipe out the germs before they erradicate you<br></li><li>Collect pills scattered about the hospital to keep the virus at bay<br></li><li>Survive the madness of crazy physics as cans, tables, chairs, computers and much, much more fly across your path<br></li><li>Rack up the multipliers and destroy the top scores<br></li><li>Bring your skills or you won't last long... this game isn't for the easy <br></li><li><strong>Halloween Update - Now includes 'The Grounds' outdoor level and all new nasties to eliminate!</strong></li></ul><br>Time is running out and you're running about!<br><br><strong>You ready to blast some bugs?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1276170/extras/143597443d0541b6e98b6168467ce739.avif?t=1680605786\" /></div>",
